%N A399692 Triangle T(n,k) read by rows of Knuth's deltas for comparison trees used in a uniform binary search.
%C A399692 An auxiliary table of deltas is used in Algorithm C (Uniform binary search) in Don Knuth's TAOCP Vol. 3.
%D A399692 D. E. Knuth, The Art of Computer Programming Second Edition. Vol. 3, Sorting and Searching. Chapter 6.2.1 Searching an ordered table, page 415. Addison-Wesley, Reading, MA, 1998.
%F A399692 T(n,k) = floor((n + 2^(k-1))/2^k), for 1 <= k <= floor(log_2(n)) + 2.
